han focusing on analysis or scenario planning.",[],{"_key":591,"_type":438,"children":592,"markDefs":597,"style":472},"b915b0494e8f",[593],{"_key":594,"_type":442,"marks":595,"text":596},"273f9c92f63e",[],"The Risk Cost: Errors, Compliance, and Audit Headaches",[],{"_key":599,"_type":438,"children":600,"markDefs":605,"style":447},"33c14b7d4940",[601],{"_key":602,"_type":442,"marks":603,"text":604},"0afd5a9c9cab",[],"Every additional spreadsheet or manual reconciliation increases the risk of error, which in turn raises exposure. Errors create extra work, compliance concerns, and reputational risk.",[],{"_key":607,"_type":438,"children":608,"markDefs":613,"style":447},"cf864bde1e16",[609],{"_key":610,"_type":442,"marks":611,"text":612},"b08b73e24e7e",[],"Key Risk Categories:",[],{"_key":615,"_type":438,"children":616,"level":17,"listItem":527,"markDefs":621,"style":447},"338bab091fc3",[617],{"_key":618,"_type":442,"marks":619,"text":620},"481f67dc43e3",[],"Audit errors: Missing documentation, inconsistent reconciliations, or late adjustments trigger red flags.",[],{"_key":623,"_type":438,"children":624,"level":17,"listItem":527,"markDefs":629,"style":447},"e51550361b09",[625],{"_key":626,"_type":442,"marks":627,"text":628},"28b2f61d9a76",[],"Internal control weaknesses: Without centralized task tracking, approvals may be skipped or delayed.",[],{"_key":631,"_type":438,"children":632,"level":17,"listItem":527,"markDefs":637,"style":447},"12b48c8033b6",[633],{"_key":634,"_type":442,"marks":635,"text":636},"acfd3aba1f7c",[],"Regulatory penalties: Inaccurate statements or late filings can result in fines, restatements, or reputational harm.",[],{"_key":639,"_type":438,"children":640,"markDefs":645,"style":447},"c758335998a9",[641],{"_key":642,"_type":442,"marks":643,"text":644},"d80f4077afc9",[],"Even the most capable teams can miss something during a manual close. One small slip can turn into a major headache, especially in a fast-growing organization. When audits uncover discrepancies, teams end up scrambling to rebuild documentation, focus disappears, and stress skyrockets.",[],{"_key":647,"_type":438,"children":648,"markDefs":653,"style":447},"46d42c5b7da5",[649],{"_key":650,"_type":442,"marks":651,"text":652},"b628f5ef8d4f",[],"There is a better way. With automation, task tracking happens automatically, audit trails are built in, real-time dashboards keep everyone informed, and AI-driven reconciliations handle the heavy lifting. Instead of bracing for last-minute emergencies, finance leaders walk into audits calm and prepared, backed by accurate data and clear documentation.",[],{"_key":655,"_type":438,"children":656,"markDefs":661,"style":472},"e107be829923",[657],{"_key":658,"_type":442,"marks":659,"text":660},"d2d8e82c6506",[],"The Opportunity Cost: What Finance Could Be Doing Instead",[],{"_key":663,"_type":438,"children":664,"markDefs":669,"style":447},"3b66bd4635ef",[665],{"_key":666,"_type":442,"marks":667,"text":668},"4e26a5c1a741",[],"A broken close wastes time and increases risk, but it also blocks teams from creating real value. Every hour devoted to low-value tasks is an hour not spent on forecasting, scenario planning, or partnering with leadership on growth initiatives.",[],{"_key":671,"_type":438,"children":672,"markDefs":677,"style":447},"96e50fcc409b",[673],{"_key":674,"_type":442,"marks":675,"text":676},"c15a405db97c",[],"Automation of the month-end close gives finance teams the breathing room they have been craving. It opens the door to real analysis and strategic work instead of endless number crunching. ",[],{"_key":679,"_type":438,"children":680,"markDefs":685,"style":447},"e053d1d212a0",[681],{"_key":682,"_type":442,"marks":683,"text":684},"610a933d58d6",[],"CFOs can model investment scenarios. Controllers gain the time to build rolling forecasts. Accounting teams can focus on strengthening controls rather than constantly putting out fires. The shift is powerful. Finance stops being seen as a back-office function and starts being recognized as a true partner driving insights and business decisions.",[],{"_key":687,"_type":438,"children":688,"markDefs":693,"style":447},"b334a88887ae",[689],{"_key":690,"_type":442,"marks":691,"text":692},"f330cf532206",[],"AI-powered workflows do more than speed things up. They reduce errors, accelerate close cycles, and transform raw numbers into meaningful insights that leadership can act on with confidence.",[],{"_key":695,"_type":567,"data":696,"image":707,"markDefs":9,"type":580},"2ab85d481011",{"alt":9,"altText":697,"asset":698,"bgColor":700,"caption":9,"dimensions":701,"lqip":705,"originalFilename":706},"Nominal infographic comparing broken close vs. modern close across timeline, risk, and team impact for multi-entity finance teams",{"_ref":699,"_type":13},"image-2696c66b62f136b3dc50a82a0ce8709a6fd05338-1106x2024-png","#acf3dc",{"_type":16,"aspectRatio":702,"height":703,"width":704},0.5464426877470355,2024,1106,"data:image\u002Fpng;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAlCAYAAABCr8kFAAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAF90lEQVR4nI1V2W4cxxWdnzDiGHmMkcAvQZx8iJ0oC\u002FLgAFkM+GsCWKZFaUiJjAIBiQEhr15gRVak2JIii9vsQ85wtl5rr+rqIQfHuNXUcKhQQB4OqutW3TO36py6U1MuxWWQNgFXMXIxA1cRhInBdTXS2qvyapcFtcvAVIT+oIndg6dodnbQPTpAf9jAND4KpP83obQJhI6R5CMctL7F10++wrOdr7Gz\u002FwR7jf9iMGojl9NXVll7OUDHoir6gwYa7ec4aD1Dq7sbqmx0nqM3aGA06yFlo0tJa5cRjqI+Gv097HSf4+BwD+1hA82jfez3d9E42kdv1EKUDS89em151KUQEWZshG7Uw\u002F60HdCKuuhEPTRnHTSjDvrpIWI+DnvlS1UuCYVNkMoppukQw+gQvaiHdtRFe9YJZDTvxj10oi76cQ\u002FH8SGm6SDkUO4FQm4TjNQEzewIO7MOvp20KkwrPJ+2l1jOJy3sTNshZ6SmgWNJmNsEHTnB46SPR1EXD6NuGAPiXoWV+X\u002FO5g+jDr5J+yE3XxLaFDEbozls42lvD4+7u3jcOUN3D08othqnsUux6vtJdxeNYTtwKJegRkrtN5\u002Fh7j\u002F\u002Fjq3bG7j11zo2b10P2NquY\u002Fv2Jm5u3UD95jVs3FzHBq1t17H1t01s3d4M+z65eydwEFeNmxi7jaf4x9072Ni+jvqta1jf+Ajr9au4sbmGGzc\u002Fxtr1D3H12l+wduNDfFy\u002Fimuba6hvr6O+tY71jTXc+eR2eFGBkGRP8gkGx4foD3oBvX4b7c4BmoRuNba6TbR6Tex39rHf3gtxmrd7LRwd95Hk1esJothCwPsCJycnOD09xdx7WK2glIQ2GtZZeO\u002FhfAGhJIQUMNbAFQ5F4eFLD+vluShEWJY+kBF8UUAKAcYYGGcQXARiVxQwzsJYG75pn\\\u002FphVv2NKptBOwFbKDivoQwpnUNqBqV5gLbkUwFhGKRhYY+kNUNrPKgsTILavfufgvCvrz5fwWe4d\u002F8z3H\u002FwBR48+hIPH93Dg4df4v6\u002FvwhxwsX9n+NeyPkUtSu\u002FfAcV3j0b38GVK9X4299cwR\u002F\u002F9Ht88MGf8f77f8B77\u002F0Ov\u002F7VL873XYLa9157bfEq\u002FOCN7y\u002FeeuvHi5\u002F\u002F7O3F2z\u002F9yeJHb\u002F5w8cbrr79yP+V8B4D7bu8z4kS0AAAAAElFTkSuQmCC","Infographic - Broken Close vs. Modern Close.png",{"_type":580,"asset":708},{"_ref":699,"_type":13},{"_key":710,"_type":438,"children":711,"markDefs":716,"style":472},"9a25e807761a",[712],{"_key":713,"_type":442,"marks":714,"text":715},"6e0f5adaba6e",[],"How to Recognize a Broken Close",[],{"_key":718,"_type":438,"children":719,"markDefs":724,"style":447},"a08697dc279e",[720],{"_key":721,"_type":442,"marks":722,"text":723},"e5587b8afc6f",[],"There are a few clear signs that a month-end close is broken, and they are hard to ignore once you see them. When a finance team is relying on dozens of spreadsheets just to reconcile accounts and manage task lists, the process is already too fragile. When consolidated financials take more than a week after month-end to finalize, leadership is left waiting on outdated numbers to make critical decisions. ",[],{"_key":726,"_type":438,"children":727,"markDefs":732,"style":447},"f5a7f720fd21",[728],{"_key":729,"_type":442,"marks":730,"text":731},"dbe2d4ea48f4",[],"And when auditors are constantly flagging inconsistencies or requesting extra documentation, stress levels rise, overtime piles up, and confidence in the process starts to crumble. Perhaps the most telling sign of all is when the team spends more time gathering and checking data than actually analyzing it. That is not what high-performing finance teams should be doing.",[],{"_key":734,"_type":438,"children":735,"markDefs":740,"style":447},"1714d43f027a",[736],{"_key":737,"_type":442,"marks":738,"text":739},"4b0731f56d4d",[],"Here is the thing: none of these problems are permanent. They are not a reflection of a team’s talent or work ethic. They are a reflection of outdated systems. Finance leaders who embrace modern close-automation tools quickly see the difference. Processes speed up, accuracy improves, and team morale lifts. People finally have time to think, plan, and contribute strategically instead of drowning in repetitive tasks. That is the real power of change.",[],{"_key":742,"_type":438,"children":743,"markDefs":748,"style":447},"2b4d61d83000",[744],{"_key":745,"_type":442,"marks":746,"text":747},"28683c11e19f",[],"The cost of a broken close isn’t just measured in hours lost. It shows up in missed insights, audit stress, and delayed decisions. But none of it is permanent. With the right systems in place, finance teams can move from firefighting to forward-looking and from manual tasks to meaningful impact. Nominal helps finance teams consolidate faster, reconcile automatically, and report with confidence. All without switching ERPs or adding headcount.",[],{"_key":750,"_type":438,"children":751,"markDefs":761,"style":447},"c00331dd86ec",[752,757],{"_key":753,"_type":442,"marks":754,"text":756},"49af6dee09da",[755],"f6d6837bf389","Book a demo",{"_key":758,"_type":442,"marks":759,"text":760},"35f5a5c8c4e7",[]," to see how Nominal transforms the month-end process.",[762],{"_key":755,"_type":555,"linkPageModule":30,"newTab":30,"page":763,"type":34,"url":9},{"slug":251,"title":252},{"_key":765,"_type":438,"children":766,"markDefs":780,"style":447},"df3304015571",[767,771,776],{"_key":768,"_type":442,"marks":769,"text":770},"6d689dd89d0d",[],"Next: To see what a streamlined, automated close actually looks like, continue to ",{"_key":772,"_type":442,"marks":773,"text":775},"f0baa4b83ad2",[774],"088bf313525b","Chapter 3 of the guide",{"_key":777,"_type":442,"marks":778,"text":779},"6de1b2087b79",[],". We’ll walk through each step of a modern close and how high-performing teams are building it today",[781],{"_key":774,"_type":555,"linkPageModule":30,"newTab":30,"page":782,"type":34,"url":9},{"slug":783,"title":784},"\u002Fresources\u002Fclose-guide-chapter3","What a Modern Close Looks Like",{"_key":786,"_type":787,"fullWidth":9,"htmlCode":788,"label":9,"markDefs":9},"3fc09d23f66f","htmlEmbed","\u003C!--HubSpot Call-to-Action Code -->\u003Cspan class=\"hs-cta-wrapper\" id=\"hs-cta-wrapper-79280e37-1b52-4ffd-aa40-0b18bad6ba71\">\u003Cspan class=\"hs-cta-node hs-cta-79280e37-1b52-4ffd-aa40-0b18bad6ba71\" id=\"hs-cta-79280e37-1b52-4ffd-aa40-0b18bad6ba71\">\u003C!--[if lte IE 8]>\u003Cdiv id=\"hs-cta-ie-element\">\u003C\u002Fdiv>\u003C![endif]-->\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcta-redirect.hubspot.com\u002Fcta\u002Fredirect\u002F48589798\u002F79280e37-1b52-4ffd-aa40-0b18bad6ba71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\u003Cimg class=\"hs-cta-img\" id=\"hs-cta-img-79280e37-1b52-4ffd-aa40-0b18bad6ba71\" style=\"border-width:0px;\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fno-cache.hubspot.com\u002Fcta\u002Fdefault\u002F48589798\u002F79280e37-1b52-4ffd-aa40-0b18bad6ba71.png\"  alt=\"   See Nominal in action  Schedule a free, personalized demo to explore how we can help your team        Book now \"\u002F>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fspan>\u003Cscript charset=\"utf-8\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fjs.hscta.net\u002Fcta\u002Fcurrent.js\">\u003C\u002Fscript>\u003Cscript type=\"text\u002Fjavascript\"> hbspt.cta.load(48589798, '79280e37-1b52-4ffd-aa40-0b18bad6ba71', {\"useNewLoader\":\"true\",\"region\":\"na1\"}); \u003C\u002Fscript>\u003C\u002Fspan>\u003C!-- end HubSpot Call-to-Action Code -->",[790],{"_id":791,"group":792,"slug":793,"title":795},"WHRc5NKIhsva8iXeVqk2js","resource-format",{"_type":432,"current":794},"\u002Ftag\u002Fresource-format\u002FGuides","Guides",{"description":9,"image":9,"title":9},{"alt":9,"altText":798,"asset":799,"bgColor":801,"caption":9,"dimensions":802,"lqip":806,"originalFilename":807},"The Hidden Cost of a Broken Close",{"_ref":800,"_type":13},"image-a3543cb78fe69db02ac0e92d52833b9dc3dd51e2-376x279-svg","#96a4ec",{"_